Description:It is your first main phase. You control Boggart Brute (3/2, menace) and Hill Giant (3/3). The opponent is at 3 life and controls an untapped Wall of Stone and a tapped Silent Arbiter (no more than one creature can attack or block each combat). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-menace-one-blocker | A creature with menace can't be blocked except by two or more creatures (CR 702.111b): with one creature able to attack and one able to block, Boggart Brute is unblockable and deals 3; Hill Giant can be blocked by the Wall
